---
---

<!-- Final Conversion CTA + Clean Footer -->
<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white overflow-hidden">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10">
    <div
      data-dr-anim="scale-y"
      class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] bg-[#0F054B] px-6 py-14 sm:px-14 lg:py-20 text-center text-white shadow-drnube"
    >
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 h-64 w-[500px] rounded-full bg-[#5956E9]/45 blur-3xl"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6">
        <span
          data-dr-anim="scale-y"
          class="inline-block rounded-full bg-[#5956E9] px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white"
        >
          Trato Directo con Nicolás · Sin Vueltas
        </span>

        <h2
          data-dr-anim="scale-y"
          data-dr-delay="100"
          class="font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-[54px]"
        >
          ¿Listo para digitalizar tu negocio y vender más?
        </h2>

        <p
          data-dr-anim="scale-y"
          data-dr-delay="150"
          class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed"
        >
          Escribime por WhatsApp, contame de qué es tu negocio y en 10 minutos te digo exactamente cuál es el camino más rápido para digitalizarte.
        </p>

        <div
          data-dr-anim="scale-y"
          data-dr-delay="250"
          class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4"
        >
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/5491100000000?text=Hola%20Nico!%20Vi%20tu%20web%20y%20quiero%20digitalizar%20mi%20negocio."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#5956E9] px-9 py-4 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-white shadow-drnube-btn transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-[#6355F3]"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
            </svg>
            <span>Hablar con Nicolás por WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/templates"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-8 py-4 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/20"
          >
            <span>Ver Showroom de Templates</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="border-t border-slate-100 bg-[#F6F8FF] py-12">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-8">
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#5956E9] text-white font-heading font-bold text-sm">
            NG
          </div>
          <span class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-[#27272E]">nicoguzman.dev</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#525260] max-w-sm">
          Ayudamos a comercios, profesionales y PyMEs de Argentina a digitalizarse con páginas web modernas, WhatsApp con IA y sistemas a medida.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm font-semibold text-[#525260]">
        <a href="/servicios" class="hover:text-[#5956E9]">Servicios</a>
        <a href="/templates" class="hover:text-[#5956E9]">Templates</a>
        <a href="/precios" class="hover:text-[#5956E9]">Precios</a>
        <a href="/faq" class="hover:text-[#5956E9]">FAQ</a>
        <a href="/contacto" class="hover:text-[#5956E9]">Contacto</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200/70 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-[#999FAE]">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Nicolás Guzmán · Buenos Aires, Argentina. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <p>Diseñado para velocidad, claridad y conversión.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
